### Create Admin User (First Time Setup)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin User",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123",
  "role": "admin"
}

###

### Admin Login
