### Get All Campaigns (Public - Only Approved)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/campaigns

###

### Get Campaigns with Filters
GET http://localhost:5000/api/campaigns?category=medical&page=1&limit=10

###

### Get All Campaigns (including pending - for testing)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/campaigns?status=pending

###

### Get Single Campaign(by ID)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/campaigns/67d2f8c8e4b0a1b2c3d4e5f6

###

### Get User's Campaigns
GET http://localhost:5000/api/campaigns/user/67d2f8c8e4b0a1b2c3d4e5f6

###

### Create Campaign
POST http://localhost:5000/api/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhMDk4NTY3NTI2MWQ5MTg2OWNmZWZiMSIsImlhdCI6MTc3OTAwOTA3NCwiZXhwIjoxNzgxNjAxMDc0fQ.E6sn-kj5M6EfypqkHmldW5Z0Re7LpHpZVRpZFw_bbYo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "help to punarvika",
  "description": "We need funds to protect our . Your donation will help preserve biodiversity and combat climate change.",
  "category": "environment",
  "goalAmount": 50000,
  "deadline": "2024-12-31",
  "stretchGoals": [
    {
      "amount": 75000,
      "description": "Additional conservation area protection"
    },
    {
      "amount": 100000,
      "description": "Community education and reforestation programs"
    }
  ],
  "impactUnit": "hectares protected"
}

###

### Update Campaign
